<description>&lt;p&gt;Ukrainian naval drones have struck two Russian vessels at Benghazi and off Libya's coast, sinking one warship and damaging another, and Libyan naval officers were killed in the attack. Libyan forces and militias have threatened retaliation against Ukraine, and the Libyan army chief has visited a Moroccan F-16 base as part of new security ties. Italy has summoned the Ukrainian military envoy and is considering extra security for its troops in Libya. The Kremlin declined comment on reported Russian casualties, while Ukraine expressed regret for the deaths of the Libyan officers. 2 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/world/middleeast/libya-ukraine-russia-haftar.html&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQWElvREQtZ3d6WUVoM0ZYcHA1bDlnS1k5cm9iOGh0Zm5ILWtyZ192WUxldkJpMUFVQTcycWVlcDlhLWJnNXExOEVhaE9VWW9NOEZLSlpnMHFod3NpaGRKZXl5bHNBMXZ1eGlKYzhvLUgtVDFYazA1UnFCM3E5aE4tRFFaWXFLeGVYcUJhbW02dDJmQzYzWDdMZGVXaGZFSHpoalhsaFBEU0YyMC1sQ3p3VWQ3Zkg?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivAFBVV95cUxQa0pVdDdxUURmTmd4NkNvNFAyY3pJSWVKN0RqaUZWNWlJUUlFY0NEM2swSElrZ0p6U2dlR1NNdnNCNTBRMDNCRmJicmJjbTJtc1YwRzRRRjRYUlJhSEJwQmlUdkVPelh3Z1BVY1NwYWh4d3RWMVhCQUVaMXdFUjY0cERRR05Rd2FHYnBKY0VxUHdxSVZUeVNDOXJ2dGtOVWh6MkJKWjBQUXpXLWx0M182SC1IUlBOZ2xhcDdKcw?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMibEFVX3lxTE5aMDY0d3doUTZWcHJJQzh0c05kRUNibzI0VEItWDdnUzN5MGplaFlNX3IyYUNjZ2xuUTNxZmlia01oYTltWjBlZmxhdVRsZnoxVXo3d3pYRnZSYndncEwtVXBjXzVpWjZPdUVHdQ